#: buildVars.py:14
msgid ""
"Professional tool that allows you to manage your WordPress site via REST API "
"directly from NVDA. Supports Markdown and HTML content, media uploads, and "
"multi-site configuration."
msgstr "Alat profesional yang memungkinkan Anda mengelola situs WordPress melalui REST API secara langsung dari NVDA. Mendukung konten Markdown dan HTML, pengunggahan media, dan konfigurasi multisitus."

#: buildVars.py:19
msgid ""
"- Added support for multiple saved site profiles.\n"
"- Added ability to write posts in Markdown.\n"
"- Added Media Upload, Manage Content (Edit/Trash), and Reply to Comments "
"features.\n"
"- Removed external requests library to guarantee full 64-bit and 32-bit "
"Python cross-compatibility for NVDA 2026.1 and NVDA 2025.x.\n"
"- Restructured add-on architecture to conform to standard NVDA Add-on "
"template."
msgstr ""
"- Penambahan dukungan untuk menyimpan profil multi-situs.\n"
"- Penambahan kemampuan untuk menulis postingan dalam Markdown.\n"
"- Penambahan fitur Unggah Media, Kelola Konten (Edit/Buang), dan Balas Komentar.\n"
"- Menghapus pustaka 'requests' eksternal untuk menjamin kompatibilitas silang Python 64-bit dan 32-bit secara penuh untuk NVDA 2026.1 dan NVDA 2025.x.\n"
"- Restrukturisasi arsitektur add-on agar sesuai dengan templat Add-on NVDA standar."
